---
import { BriefcaseBusiness, MessageCircle, Phone, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-astro';
import Image from './Image.astro';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative pt-32 md:pt-44 pb-24 px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-sky-100 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-900 dark:to-blue-950 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-800/30 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 -left-12 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-700/30 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-30"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
          <BriefcaseBusiness class="w-4 h-4" />
          Nicho Digital · webs premium para nichos específicos
        </span>

        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          Vendo webs que se ven
          <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"> profesionales y convierten mejor</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Diseño webs pensadas para nichos concretos, con estructura comercial, copy claro y una presentación premium para que médicos, abogados, psicólogos y otros negocios de servicios proyecten más valor y cierren más contactos.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-10">
          <a href="#contacto" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-600 transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium">
            <MessageCircle class="w-5 h-5" />
            Cotizar por WhatsApp
          </a>
          <a href="#perfil" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-700 transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium">
            <Phone class="w-5 h-5" />
            Ver nichos
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Nichos</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">médicos, legales, wellness y más</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Copy claro</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">orientado a confianza y conversión</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Entrega lista</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">para publicar y empezar a vender</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-300/30 to-sky-200/20 dark:from-blue-700/20 dark:to-cyan-700/10 blur-3xl rounded-[2rem]"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40 bg-white/95 dark:bg-gray-800/95 backdrop-blur">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-stretch">
            <div class="relative min-h-[540px] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900">
              <Image src="/images/doctor/doctor-premium-portrait.png" alt="Ejemplo premium de nicho médico" width={1024} height={1536} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
              <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/75 via-slate-900/30 to-transparent text-white">
                <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-200">Demo de nicho</div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">Médicos y especialistas</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-blue-100 mt-1">Un ejemplo de cómo se puede ver una web premium para vender confianza.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-8">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium">Oferta</div>
                  <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Webs hechas para vender</div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">
                  <ShieldCheck class="w-6 h-6" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-sky-500 text-white p-5 mb-5 shadow-lg">
                <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-100">Enfoque</div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">Menos plantilla genérica, más propuesta comercial</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-blue-50 mt-2">Cada nicho necesita mensajes, estructura y señales de confianza distintas.</div>
              </div>

              <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
                <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Landing o web completa según el nivel del negocio</div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">CTA listos para WhatsApp, formularios o agenda</div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Copy adaptado a cómo decide cada tipo de cliente</div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Base reusable para escalar demos y ventas por nicho</div>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-6 text-sm">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40 bg-blue-50/80 dark:bg-blue-950/30 p-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">
                  <div class="font-semibold">Premium visual</div>
                  <div class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Mejor percepción de valor</div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40 bg-blue-50/80 dark:bg-blue-950/30 p-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">
                  <div class="font-semibold">Conversión</div>
                  <div class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Contacto más directo y claro</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
